<title>POLAND: FORTE TURNS TO PLN 27,900 LOSS IN MAY.</title>
<headline>FORTE TURNS TO PLN 27,900 LOSS IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
